      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3"><div><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Riwayat Insentif</h2><p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-0.5">Riwayat perhitungan insentif untuk setiap transaksi.</p></div></div>
      <div class="flex flex-row flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
